  "question": {
    "text": "<p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>, the root mean square <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>rms</mi><mo>)</mo></math> speed of gas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math>&nbsp;(molar mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></math>) is equal to the most probable speed of gas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>. The molar mass of the gas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math>&nbsp;is _____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. (Nearest integer)</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The root mean square velocity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi>rms</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>RT</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>The most probable speed&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi>mp</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>RT</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo></math>Temperature in Kelvin</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>=</mo></math>Molar mass</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi>rms</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi>mp</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></msub><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>gm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
  }
